  "abstract": "Introduce a Mixture-of-Loadings (J=2) U_bank with input-adaptive softmax gating, mixed in p-space before neuron projection to preserve memory. Combined with oscillatory 2nd-order SSM factors, temporal/horizon gating, residual copy, and V-orthogonality (\u03bb=1e-5) with curvature regularization.",
